// tests: valid INFO, valid ERROR, malformed timestamp`},{id:`web-project`,chapter:4,title:y(`项目：短链服务`,`Project: URL shortener`),minutes:36,summary:y(`先用内存仓库完成领域闭环，再替换持久化。HTTP handler 只负责协议转换，不承担 ID 生成和验证规则。`,`Complete the domain loop with an in-memory repository first, then replace persistence. HTTP handlers translate protocols rather than owning ID generation and validation.`),code:`trait LinkStore {
